Maintenance changes made between SXR-CLI-03's acceptance and SXR-CLI-04's
baseline, on the reviewer's approval. None of them touch src/ or tests/.

These three hunks are RECONSTRUCTED rather than machine-generated, because none
of the three files sits inside a per-slice snapshot: the two audit scripts live
under audit/ (never snapshotted), and /docs/ is gitignored, so `git ls-files -o
--exclude-standard docs` returned nothing and every earlier baseline silently
contained no docs file. Each hunk is a single edit whose exact before-text is the
line block shown, and the after-text is verbatim what is on disk now.

